-- The all-quantifier and the empty fiber (decision record setHop; spec §5, §9). Split from s05d-set-hop; twin of s05c-empty-pen.bqn.
-- Five animals, four pens, one id space: animals are rows 0-4, pens rows 5-8. penOf points each animal at its pen; livestock is the inverse read, each pen's fiber of animals. &/ livestock'.Healthy asks: all my animals healthy? Pen 8 holds no animals at all, and the empty fiber takes the fold's identity — &/ of nothing is true, so the empty pen IS Certified, vacuously; #/ of nothing is 0, so its Headcount says so.
--! registry ../registries/s05c-empty-pen.reg
--! expect certified = 0 0 0 0 0 1 0 1 1
--! expect headcount = 0 0 0 0 0 2 2 1 0

Pen & &/ livestock'.Healthy , +Certified
Pen , Headcount = #/ livestock'
